h:34%&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Definition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;gppd:commissioningYear&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;owl:DatatypeProperty&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;dbo:PowerStation&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;xsd:decimal&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Year the plant started operating; for multi-unit plants the capacity-weighted average, so it can be fractional.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;gppd:capacityDataYear&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;owl:DatatypeProperty&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;dbo:PowerStation&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;xsd:gYear&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Year in which the installed capacity value was reported.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;gppd:plant&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;owl:ObjectProperty, qb:DimensionProperty&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;qb:Observation&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;dbo:PowerStation&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;The power plant an annual generation observation refers to.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;gppd:estimationMethod&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;owl:ObjectProperty, qb:AttributeProperty&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;qb:Observation&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;skos:Concept&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;The model used to estimate an annual generation value.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;gppd:WEPPIdentifier&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;owl:Class, rdfs:subClassOf adms:Identifier&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;–&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;–&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Identifier of a plant in the World Electric Power Plants (WEPP) database.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="950" width="900" height="230" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="res-title" value="New resources described with existing classes" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1020" y="920" width="580" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="res" value="&lt;table style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#e6edf6;width:28%&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;New resource (instance, not a class)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#e6edf6;width:22%&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Type&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;background:#e6edf6;width:50%&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Purpose&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;gppd:FuelScheme&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;skos:ConceptScheme&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Members are skos:Concept with skos:notation and skos:prefLabel. The 15 fuel categories: Biomass, Coal, Cogeneration, Gas, Geothermal, Hydro, Nuclear, Oil, Other, Petcoke, Solar, Storage, Waste, Wave and Tidal, Wind.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;gppd:EstimationMethodScheme&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;skos:ConceptScheme&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Members are skos:Concept with skos:notation and skos:prefLabel. The 5 methods: CAPACITY-FACTOR-V1, HYDRO-V1, SOLAR-V1, SOLAR-V1-NO-AGE, WIND-V1.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;gppd:generationDSD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;qb:DataStructureDefinition&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Dimensions gppd:plant and sdmx-dimension:refPeriod; measure sdmx-measure:obsValue; attributes sdmx-attribute:unitMeasure and gppd:estimationMethod.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;gppd:reportedGeneration, gppd:estimatedGeneration&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;qb:DataSet, dcat:Dataset&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Reported (2013–2019) and estimated (2013–2017) annual generation.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1020" y="950" width="580" height="300" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="rules" value="&lt;b&gt;Conversion and validation rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Capacity: capacity_mw × 1,000,000 → dbo:installedCapacity in watts.&lt;br&gt;• Location: POINT(longitude latitude) from the latitude and longitude columns.&lt;br&gt;• One qb:Observation per plant, year and non-empty value. An empty cell creates no observation; zero is a real value.&lt;br&gt;• Reported observations have no estimation method. Estimated observations have exactly one, and NO-ESTIMATION is not a method.&lt;br&gt;• Each observation has exactly one dataset, plant, year, value and unit (unit:GigaW-HR).&lt;br&gt;• Country: country:{ISO code} from the country column. owl:sameAs links only where the match is checked." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#ffffff;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="1200" width="900" height="135" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="wd" value="&lt;b&gt;Wikidata item&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;same organisation in Wikidata&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="120" width="280" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e16" value="owl:sameAs [0..1]" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.2;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="og" target="wd"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1080" y="314" /><mxPoint x="1080" y="150" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="authors" value="Group 2 · Seminars, Workshop A · Tomás Macedo, Mara Almasan, Anabel Dautovic" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="44" width="900" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>